  designNotes: "2026-08-29, user request (Meshy_AI_Man_in_Black_at_the_P_biped '_biped.zip',
    'Scene' take, 2.07s, Humanoid retarget onto \u5C41\u5B69\u738B). Forward charging
    double-palm strike. Measured offline (x1.5 rig). LARGE baked forward travel (root
    ~6m over t=0-0.5); motion-EXTRACTED / useRootMotion=0. Wired window t=0.38-0.50:
    both hands thrust forward, Lh ~0.56m local at v10, Y ~1.7. maxDistance conservative
    1.15. FULL charge = useRootMotion=1 + root-motion-trap fix - follow-up. First-pass:
    26 HP / 20 poise / knockback 10 (shove) / no launch / cooldown 5. m_Speed 1.2.\n\n2026-08-29
    follow-up (\u4F7F\u7528\u8005:\u300C\u9019\u5169\u62DB\u61C9\u8A72\u90FD\u662F\u6709\u4F4D\u79FB\u7684
    \u76EE\u524D\u6C92\u770B\u5230\u300D): useRootMotion=1. BossAnimatorRootMotionRelay
    on \u5C41\u5B69\u738B/Visual (empty OnAnimatorMove + applyRootMotion=1) makes
    Animator.deltaPosition valid; ApplyMotion also gated on CurrentState==Attack
    (root-motion trap fix); deltaPosition.y zeroed. rm window 0.05-0.45 (cut early
    - full clip ~7m@1.5x). Distances/windows first-pass, user tunes."
